# Aether: the repo is LF, except where a patch has to carry bytes verbatim.
# A hunk that patches a CRLF upstream file (ipc/app/module.ver) must keep its
# CRLF content lines or `git apply` refuses it; normalizing to LF breaks the
# series on a fresh clone. Patches are therefore stored byte-exact.
* text=auto eol=lf
patches/** -text
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.xpi binary
*.bmp binary
# 7zSD.sfx parses sfx-config.txt and requires CRLF; no conversion.
branding/sfx-config.txt -text
